{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05221","headline":"谪南海过始兴广胜寺果上人房 · 房融","name":"谪南海过始兴广胜寺果上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"零落嗟残命，萧条托胜因。\n方烧三界火，遽洗六情尘。\n隔岭天花发，凌空月殿新。\n谁令乡国梦，终此学分身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}